1
00:00:00,103 --> 00:00:04,697
A Hike That Changed Course Our hike began on a winding trail

2
00:00:04,711 --> 00:00:09,368
beside a barren slope We passed a rocky overhang a shallow cave

3
00:00:09,382 --> 00:00:12,237
with a hollow echo and a clearing where a lily grew in

4
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:16,790
the shade The guide asked us to tread carefully on loose gravel

5
00:00:16,803 --> 00:00:20,829
and avoid the fragile edge of the path At noon a fallen

6
00:00:20,842 --> 00:00:25,974
tree made the intended route inaccessible We could not bypass it safely

7
00:00:26,882 --> 00:00:30,355
Some walkers wanted to cling to the original plan but the guide

8
00:00:30,368 --> 00:00:34,829
chose a longer descent We would traverse the lower ridge turn at

9
00:00:34,842 --> 00:00:40,171
a fence and return through a neighbouring village The change caused disappointment

10
00:00:40,368 --> 00:00:44,724
yet nobody had to prove courage by taking a needless risk We

11
00:00:44,737 --> 00:00:48,789
ate a snack tightened a bootlace and resumed at a comfortable pace

12
00:00:49,697 --> 00:00:54,540
A successful journey does not always reach the planned summit Sometimes its

13
00:00:54,553 --> 00:00:58,658
achievement lies in recognizing when a sensible alteration is necessary
